1
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:53,140
Tang Zhiluo, are you still going to run away?

2
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:17,240
Zhiluo.

3
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,930
Why isn't Su Zhiye here yet?

4
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:37,280
I heard from the Su family's servants

5
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,400
that he left this morning

6
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,800
and hasn't returned yet.

7
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,090
Did he say when he would be back?

8
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:47,840
He only said he was going to a banquet at Huizhen Pavilion.

9
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:54,660
Send someone to Prince Yu's Mansion.

10
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:57,900
Have him pass a message to Princess Xiyao for me.

11
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:38,370
If Prince Yu wants to eliminate Jingxuan's right-hand man,

12
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:39,840
he doesn't have to go this far.

13
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,720
Yuwen Jingxuan.

14
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:43,480
He is not worth me doing this.

15
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:47,960
Hahaha.

16
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:49,520
What are you laughing at?

17
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,760
So that's how it is.

18
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:55,160
I'm laughing because Prince Yu has exhausted all his schemes,

19
00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:57,820
yet still couldn't resist the charm of a beauty.

20
00:03:58,880 --> 00:03:59,960
Su Zhiye.

21
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:06,290
You were the one who handed her over to me personally.

22
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:53,360
It's easy to mend clothes.

23
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:57,080
But trust between people is hard to mend.

24
00:04:57,600 --> 00:05:00,280
Your Highness, I am from beyond the Great Wall.

25
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:04,600
I really don't understand the hidden meanings of you Central Plains people.

26
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,080
I'll just speak my mind.

27
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:10,730
That makes me seem less straightforward.

28
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:14,440
I hope you can release Su,

29
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:16,680
Young Master Su.

30
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:18,680
Yuwen Jingxuan told you, didn't he?

31
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:22,260
In what capacity are you saying this?

32
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,120
Princess Consort Yu,

33
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,880
or Princess of Rouran?

34
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:28,560
As Xiyao.

35
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,240
Not the Princess of Rouran,

36
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,760
nor Princess Consort Yu.

37
00:05:36,159 --> 00:05:38,720
If you want the right to negotiate with me,

38
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:44,680
I'm afraid there is only one thing

39
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:48,200
that can be used as a bargaining chip.

40
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:54,520
I really overestimated you, Your Highness.

41
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:55,450
Overestimated?

42
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:59,480
Giving what you gave to Su Zhiye

43
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:01,120
to me,

44
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:05,410
you call that overestimating?

45
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:47,800
Meeting you

46
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,640
was like a dream.

47
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:53,010
I will remember it forever.

48
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,480
Oh.

49
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:58,840
Smell this.

50
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,280
Smell it.

51
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,320
I will give myself to you.

52
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:21,200
Zhiluo.

53
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:24,200
What's wrong?

54
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,920
Yuwen Jingxuan,

55
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:28,040
I remember now.

56
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,140
After all we've been through,

57
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:38,600
this is the first time

58
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:41,080
I've looked at you so carefully.

59
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:50,850
I remember everything.

60
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:02,840
Don't think too much.

61
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:06,160
As long as we are together,

62
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:08,800
there is always a way.

63
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:30,580
We were one step behind after all.

64
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:33,600
If I hadn't been poisoned, maybe...

65
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:36,880
Don't say such things.

66
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,880
We haven't reached a dead end yet.

67
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,560
Shang Zaiyi has been plotting for years,

68
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:47,040
and has the Imperial Preceptor's guidance behind him.

69
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:48,840
I can make a risky move.

70
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:50,880
But you can't.

71
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:54,440
Zhiluo,

72
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,820
don't you understand yet?

73
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:58,880
In my heart,

74
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,120
neither imperial power nor my life

75
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,380
is as important as you.

76
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:08,050
What about the people of the world?

77
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:11,280
Are you really going to let someone like Yuwen Jia...

78
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:13,740
To decide the fate of the people in the world?

79
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:21,660
I'm going out for a bit.

80
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:23,880
Get some rest.

81
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:27,280
The prince received a note.

82
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:37,200
Just as I thought.

83
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,600
To take my life,

84
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,330
Yuwen Jia will stop at nothing.

85
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,240
I'll go with you.

86
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,120
Trust me.

87
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:07,690
Yuwen Jia, you broke your promise.

88
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:12,600
What kind of person do you think I am, Princess?

89
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,320
Aren't you afraid of the Su family?

90
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:17,720
As long as I kill Yuwen Jingxuan,

91
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,760
the whole world will be mine.

92
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:23,200
Are we afraid of the Su family?

93
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:24,920
Burn it.

94
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:27,960
Stop.

95
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:31,160
You came at the right time, Sixth Brother.

96
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:32,440
I'm here.

97
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:35,080
You can let them go now, Brother.

98
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:39,000
There's no rush.

99
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:50,400
Zhiluo.

100
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:52,520
Zhiluo.

101
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:55,500
Sixth Brother.

102
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,840
There are more ways to control a person's mind in this world

103
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,440
than just the Soul-Destroying Nail.

104
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:00,680
Kill him.

105
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:14,640
Stop.

106
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,960
Prince Yu,

107
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:22,200
I won the bet.

108
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:25,240
You couldn't bear to let me die.
